sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant App as Application Code
    participant Expr as Expression Tree (AST)
    participant Dyn as System.Reflection.Emit.DynamicMethod
    participant JIT as RyuJIT Compiler
    participant Del as Compiled Delegate (Func)

    App->>Expr: expr.Compile()
    Expr->>Dyn: Create DynamicMethod and ILGenerator
    Note over Dyn: Emits CIL opcodes: ldarg.0, callvirt, ldc.i4, ret
    Dyn->>JIT: Request compilation of dynamic method IL
    JIT->>JIT: Compile IL to native CPU instructions in Dynamic Code Heap
    JIT->>Del: Bind native code pointer to delegate instance
    Del-->>App: Return Func<T, TResult>
    App->>Del: Invoke delegate (Executes in ~1.2 ns, 0 B allocated)
